#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-modules/perl-xml-simple.xml:66
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of XML::Simple"
msgstr "Instalação do \"XML::Simple\""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/perl-modules/perl-xml-simple.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"During the configuration process, the build system will complain about "
"missing the <application>XML::SAX::Expat</application> module.  If "
"<application>XML::SAX</application> is installed, this module is not "
"necessary as <application>XML::SAX</application> will use the "
"<application>libxml2</application> package instead. However, if it is not "
"installed, <xref linkend=\"perl-xml-parser\"/> will get used instead."
msgstr ""
"Durante o processo de configuração, o sistema de construção reclamará acerca"
" do módulo ausente <application>XML::SAX::Expat</application>. Se "
"<application>XML::SAX</application> estiver instalado, esse módulo não é "
"necessário, pois <application>XML::SAX</application> usará o pacote "
"<application>libxml2</application>. Entretanto, se ele não estiver "
"instalado, <xref linkend=\"perl-xml-parser\"/> será usado."
